Bind Npc 24202 Zone 1

On greeting
    If quest 519 is started and player lacks 910209000
        Say "You forgot? I'll give it to you one last time."
        Topic "Confirm" do
            Transaction
                Give 1 of 910209000
    Else if quest 646 is started and player has 900198000
        Say "How precious! You are great. Thank you. Let me write you a receipt."
        Topic "Confirm" do
            Transaction
                Take 1 of 900198000
                Give 1 of 900195000
    Else if quest 646 is started
        Say "Where's the fruit box?"
    Else
        Say ""
